Open a long file in a window that shows only its top, then select the whole file
from the command window (the sam address ","). The host sends a dot that runs far
past the visible region, so flfp0p1 clamps the selection end (and start) to the
number of on-screen characters before drawing the tick at the window edge.

-- file --
this is line number 1 of a fairly long test file for scrolling
this is line number 2 of a fairly long test file for scrolling
